@IdentityApiHost = http://localhost:5143

### Discovery document
GET {{IdentityApiHost}}/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

### Request an access token (client credentials)
POST {{IdentityApiHost}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=quiz_m2m&client_secret=secret&scope=quiz_api

